# 10. Understand the RollingUpdate

With 3 replicas, conceptually:

```text
Before:

v1 → Pod A
v1 → Pod B
v1 → Pod C
```

During rollout:

```text
v1 → Pod A
v1 → Pod B
v2 → Pod D
```

Then:

```text
v1 → Pod A
v2 → Pod D
v2 → Pod E
```

Finally:

```text
v2 → Pod D
v2 → Pod E
v2 → Pod F
```

The old version is gradually replaced.

