# 24. Deployment Troubleshooting

If a rollout gets stuck:

```cmd
oc get deployment
```

Then:

```cmd
oc get pods
```

Then:

```cmd
oc describe deployment <deployment-name>
```

Then:

```cmd
oc describe pod <pod-name>
```

Then:

```cmd
oc logs <pod-name>
```

Finally:

```cmd
oc get events --sort-by=.lastTimestamp
```

Troubleshooting flow:

```text
Rollout Problem
      ↓
Deployment Status
      ↓
Pod Status
      ↓
Pod Events
      ↓
Application Logs
      ↓
Root Cause
```

