# 🏁 Lesson 18 Goal


> **A Deployment strategy controls how OpenShift replaces an old application version with a new version. RollingUpdate gradually replaces Pods, while Recreate removes the old Pods before creating the new Pods. Blue/Green and Canary are deployment patterns used to reduce deployment risk.**

The core model:

```text
Deployment
     |
     v
Deployment Strategy
     |
     +---- RollingUpdate
     |
     +---- Recreate
     |
     +---- Blue/Green
     |
     +---- Canary
```

### OpenShift troubleshooting mindset

```text
Deployment
    ↓
Pods
    ↓
Events
    ↓
Logs
    ↓
Root Cause
    ↓
Fix
    ↓
Rollout
    ↓
Verify
```

